      {
        "id": 17660,
        "title": "setTimeout",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JavaScript memiliki beberapa method native yang menjalankan kode secara asynchronous, seperti <code>setTimeout()</code> dan <code>setInterval()</code>.</p><p>Dalam bab ini, kita akan melihat method <code>setTimeout()</code> menggunakan contoh-contoh seperti game.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149752,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Method <code>setTimeout()</code> menetapkan timer, dalam milidetik, yang menjalankan fungsi atau blok kode saat timer berakhir.</p><p>Tulis metode <code>setTimeout</code> pertamamu dalam kode contoh.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player can move now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode di sini bersifat asinkron. Artinya, saat kita menunggu <em>callback</em> dijalankan, kode setelah metode <code>setTimeout</code> akan berjalan.</p><p>Output console dari method <code>setTimeout</code> akan ditampilkan terakhir karena adanya penundaan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player can move now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149754,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parameter <code>delay</code> adalah waktu, dalam milidetik, yang berlalu sebelum fungsi atau blok kode dijalankan.</p><p>Dalam kode berikut, atur penundaan <code>2000</code> milidetik agar blok kode dijalankan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up charging&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ready after 2 seconds&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Keep playing while it charges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setTimeout()</code> selalu bersifat asynchronous, meskipun parameter <code>delay</code> dihilangkan atau kita menetapkannya sebagai <code>0</code>.</p><p>Dengan <code>delay</code> sebesar <code>0</code>, kode setelah metode <code>setTimeout()</code> langsung dijalankan, tetapi fungsi callback dijalankan <em>sesegera mungkin</em>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Deferred UI update (runs asap)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame end&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149756,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setTimeout()</code> menjalankan <code>callback</code> setelah <code>delay</code> yang ditentukan.</p><p>Kode <em>setelah</em><code>setTimeout</code> terus dijalankan terlepas dari apakah callback atau blok kode digunakan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"120\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned after delay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(spawnEnemy, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player exploring...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>spawnEnemy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
